  "prompt": "In the forex_data folder on the desktop there is exchange_rates.csv, which contains the exchange rate matrix of 8 currencies.\n\nTask:\n1. Read the exchange rate matrix\n2. Find all triangular arbitrage opportunities: currency A -> currency B -> currency C -> currency A, and check whether rate(A,B)*rate(B,C)*rate(C,A) > 1.0\n3. Calculate the expected profit percentage for each opportunity\n4. Write the results to arbitrage_results.json and save it to the desktop\n\nOutput format:\n{\n  \"opportunities\": [\n    {\"path\": [\"USD\",\"EUR\",\"GBP\",\"USD\"], \"product\": 1.003, \"profit_pct\": 0.3},\n    ...\n  ],\n  \"total_opportunities\": 5,\n  \"best_opportunity\": {\"path\": [...], \"profit_pct\": 0.5}\n}\n\nNote: include only opportunities with positive profit (opportunity).",
